  <item>
    <title>如果你也跟我一样会磕，你的cp也会结婚</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e380401d989496e7ec009a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e380401d989496e7ec009a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Apr 2026 13:06:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闲暇小岛的伙伴，欢迎来玩。</span></p><p><span>本期播客讲的是主播航空路春夏追了十年的泰剧初心cp，nadech yaya这一对泰国顶流cp是如何一步步假戏真做，长跑十五年，步入婚姻殿堂的。</span></p><p><span>祝贺我的cp结婚了，新婚快乐，等着看后面两场盛大婚礼。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> 我是怎么磕上naya的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a> 我最爱的naya八部剧里的top3</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> cp成真的几个关键节点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">30:12</a> 澄清一些关于naya的无稽之谈和黑料洗脑包</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2227">37:07</a> 顶流cp是怎么秀恩爱的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2482">41:22</a> 我也曾经以为他们会be</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2702">45:02</a> 泰国顶流cp的商业价值</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3256">54:16</a> 泰国全民嫁hiso的时代，仿佛泰国偶像剧剧本的naya爱情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 跟着我，按图索骥磕到真cp</span></p><p><span>拓展阅读：</span></p><p><span>《筑梦庄园》</span></p><p><span>《名门绅士》</span></p><p><span>《爱与罚》</span></p><p><span>《烈日梦痕》</span></p><p><span>《换错身嫁对人》</span></p><p><span>《公主罗曼史》</span></p><p><span>《金娜丽花纹》</span></p><p><span>《人生的波动》</span></p><p><span>《欲念之力》</span></p><p><span>《鬼滴语》</span></p><p><span>《三面娜迦》</span></p><p><span>《天沙》</span></p><p><span>《天生一对》</span></p>]]></description>
