  <item>
    <title>2025年泰腐年终盘点——群雄争霸的泰腐终于有意思了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6955264e2db086f897129b65</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6955264e2db086f897129b65</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 13:53:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闲暇小岛，欢迎所有需要闲暇的伙伴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025年的最后一期节目，紧赶慢赶终于赶到25年最后一天更新，大家刚好可以听着这期节目迎来崭新的26年，剧荒的大家来补补泰腐，让一些遗珠好剧快乐过年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目将继续由航空路春夏和双饭团小子和大家一起过年。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 2024年压宝的四部剧居然只有黄金血拍完了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">02:54</a> 鸡妈妈推介会便秘一样的制作效率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> 春夏科普25年新的泰腐制作形式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">08:13</a> dmd (倒霉蛋）拍恋综的草台班子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> 泰小说（制作人）+海鹅海桃的绑定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">20:43</a>抱胁让海鹅赚到了一桶金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 双饭团小子不明白为什么泰腐繁殖cp还能火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 泰国人爱磕cp是深入骨髓的文化基因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1807">30:07</a> 航空路春夏拉回脱泰的双饭团的搞笑剧是me and thee</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a> 航空路春夏2025年今年泰腐top3:指尖浪漫，灵魂重生，男神俱乐部（force mark篇）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">47:08</a> 2026年鸡妈妈推介会压宝剧：</span></p><span></span><p><span>dewtee mr.kill&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>winnysatang 我的职业男友</span></p><span></span><p><span>威鲨 you maniac&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>拓展阅读：</span></p><span></span><p><span>穿越天街来爱你</span></p><span></span><p><span>抱胁</span></p><span></span><p><span>that summer</span></p><span></span><p><span>占卜师男友</span></p><span></span><p><span>梦中情人</span></p>]]></description>
