  <item>
    <title>十八楼夜谈之橹穆事变</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f4697b22654730202a7a03</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f4697b22654730202a7a03</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Oct 2025 05:08:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闲暇小岛，欢迎所有需要闲暇的伙伴！</span></p><p><span>本期是期异常艰难的更新，涉及到5h的原始素材，本来想赶到橹穆cp最火的时候发，和几位主播商量之后，还是决定让子弹飞一会。于是拖到了现在。</span></p><p><span>but 如果你想知道时代峰峻最火的橹穆cp是如何从爆火到flop</span></p><p><span>but如果你想知道早期帝国边角料，如何追楼cp</span></p><p><span>but如果你想了解tf家族是如何利用cp，制造cp的</span></p><p><span>but如果你想知道楼和楼丝的爱恨纠葛</span></p><p><span>本期视频不容错过。本期航空路春夏将和双饭团小子，小福一起跟大家聊聊王橹杰和穆祉丞这对cp是如何短短半年完成顶流到发卖再到提纯的超高速产品路的。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> TFBOYS的粉丝为啥叫做帝国粉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 三位主播楼内主推cp</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a> 橹穆是谁，为何出圈，为何被发卖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="482">08:02</a> 发卖后的脂粉下场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 发卖cp粉对两人的影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> tf家族特有的高会和冲数据</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 橹穆双方在路人粉里的转换率</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 塑造cp在十八楼的重要性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1638">27:18</a> 橹穆里参杂真心是出圈关键</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a> 被发卖后的cp粉继续追是一种心理保护</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a> 发卖cp粉的穆祉丞不是成熟的艺人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 转橹毛的小福开始go四代</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2745">45:45</a> 王橹杰本人被发卖cp后的超稳心态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> tf家族特有的top圈小孩联合是社畜反抗老板</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3470">57:50</a> 公司放弃橹穆剧本</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3575">59:35</a> 四代还可能产生顶流cp么</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/620c67fe8b31a4ab6bc4824b/lukWKoM2kDTWINuG7tHzhWq4y0-o.m4a" length="45588376" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fha6W02km6m3-VLmJA2nfFgoXAK0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>脱口秀怎么看，脱2和喜单2不正经点评导览</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68bbb4df97178f08ee86e400</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68bbb4df97178f08ee86e400</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Sep 2025 04:29:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闲暇小岛，欢迎所有需要闲暇的伙伴！</span></p><p><span>2025年的第四期节目。现充生活了好几个月，被突然蜂拥而来的脱口秀段子拉回到了播客圈子。今年的脱口秀行业终于有了那么点短暂辉煌的样子。两个脱口秀节目打擂台的样子，便宜了我们这些脱口秀路人粉。所以就跟隔壁没有名字的主播黄黄借着这两期节目录了一期关于脱口秀入门，脱口秀我们的播客（双押 &nbsp;skr skr)。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 黄黄和春夏早已买股嘻哈夺冠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> 比起喜单2，黄黄更爱纯粹脱口秀——脱2</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 杨笠专场还能来渝之薛定谔的电力问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> 脱2和喜单2的惊喜嘉宾——黄黄：杨天真 春夏：鲁豫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> 黄黄印象深刻的脱口秀新人——抑郁症患者陈艾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">15:23</a> 黄黄的第一次线下脱口秀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> 春夏因为思文爱上线上脱口秀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> 黄黄线下体验太多，导致线上体验不好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a> 春夏和黄黄这次脱口秀混战记分别最爱的演员</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 王小利带给所有观众的力量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1997">33:17</a> 小块 脱口秀创业大王</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2023">33:43</a> 陈鸣飞 ai 中文之间的爱恨交织</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> 吴鼎 &nbsp;恭喜龙王回宫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">36:34</a> 漫才兄弟和大兵之间的家学渊源</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2296">38:16</a> 张峻 两极分化的学院式脱口秀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a> 黄黄从小帕身上看到双相的自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2526">42:06</a> 出奇一致的失望名单：kid和唐香玉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> 脱口秀混子一哥——rock</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2867">47:47</a> 一些搞笑遗珠——小四爷，房主任，黑灯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3443">57:23</a> 一些惊喜存在——小字辈双子星</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3713">1:01:53</a> 脱口秀是冒犯的艺术</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4059">1:07:39</a> 航空路春夏和黄黄的初遇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4304">1:11:44</a> 黄黄对自身职业风格的焦虑时刻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4773">1:19:33</a> 一些航空路春夏对黄黄焦虑的心灵马杀鸡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5555">1:32:35</a> 对喜单2不负责任冠军声明：我爱嘻哈 被遗忘的于翔宇</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/620c67fe8b31a4ab6bc4824b/ltpz8gMcqo52SVHt7of7A9-L1VNq.m4a" length="72728427" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:39:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fha6W02km6m3-VLmJA2nfFgoXAK0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>相亲总是相到双子座，我是不是被做局了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683d774931215eb506e7ebae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683d774931215eb506e7ebae</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Jun 2025 10:15:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闲暇小岛，欢迎所有需要闲暇的伙伴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025年的第三期节目，又是时隔2个月的更新。现充生活了好几个月，突然觉得现实生活也还是蛮有意义的，所以就跟隔壁没有名字的主播黄黄一期录了一期关于相亲的主题。大家有没有也相亲相到过双子座，欢迎大家也在本期播客下面留言，一起分享自己的相亲经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 航空路春夏和黄黄的相遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 航空路春夏和黄黄推荐的一些女性脱口秀线下活动——嘻哈要起飞了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> 航空路春夏贫瘠的恋爱史是因为一段十几年的暗恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 黄黄的初恋居然是周渝民</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> 春夏为什么开始了相亲之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> 黄黄的相亲就跟白水一样毫无印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 春夏的精彩相亲经历——相亲5个全是双子座</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2462">41:02</a> 对相亲双子座男生的一些共性提炼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2762">46:02</a> 大龄剩女是黄黄的自主选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 春夏幼稚的花束般的恋爱和相亲根本不能并行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3324">55:24</a> 男生往往比女生更精打细算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4101">1:08:21</a> 春夏删光相亲对象，和无效相亲告一段落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4537">1:15:37</a> 黄黄的一些温馨提示：爱情，你就把他当作生活馈赠的糖果就好。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/620c67fe8b31a4ab6bc4824b/luCaERJv4p5xgAgLlixRWpCuKO_7.m4a" length="76722014" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:17:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fha6W02km6m3-VLmJA2nfFgoXAK0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>大s的精彩快转人生——影视歌书四栖作品回顾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a9fa3dd74435e4a34d77e6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a9fa3dd74435e4a34d77e6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Feb 2025 13:36:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闲暇小岛欢迎需要闲暇的伙伴，我是航空路春夏。今天想跟大家分享一个我很爱的人——大 s，徐熙媛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>学生idol时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> 大s一开始就想成为idol么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 早慧的哈日追星少女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 华冈艺校的优秀毕业生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;sos和十分钟的恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 我猜时期就是拼命三娘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a> 大s 在娱乐百分百时期就是吐槽大王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="773">12:53</a> 大小爱吃是大s颜值巅峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>演员时期：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> 流星花园开启的台偶传奇生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a>我最爱的大s的偶像剧——战神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 大s诞生出的三类台偶女主角——杂草，千金，阴郁少女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 倩女幽魂开始的演技升级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 我为什么爱战神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> 转型的开始是当鬼后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a>保持通话是大s最好的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1712">28:32</a> 大s是信念感十足的演员</span></p><span></span><p><span>作者阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">30:12</a> 美容大王就是千禧年的小红书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1902">31:42</a>美容大王2揭露女明星 医美网红的小手册</span></p><span></span><p><span>创作人阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1975">32:55</a> 词人身份也精彩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">35:59</a> 天生公关策划人——转幕后也可以的大s</span></p><span></span><p><span>一些情绪碎片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 如果大s只是一个普通人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2402">40:02</a> 一些大s的经典台词</span></p>]]></description>
