  <item>
    <title>2024泰腐年终盘点——我们开始磕一种很新的兄弟感情</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6777b74a1e823e72d3f58930</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6777b74a1e823e72d3f58930</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Jan 2025 10:27:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闲暇小岛，欢迎所有需要闲暇的伙伴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025年的第一期节目，又是时隔2个月的更新。本来想赶到24年最后一天更新，结果还是拖到了现在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目将继续由航空路春夏和双饭团小子和大家唠一唠泰腐文化。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是针对2024年大火的泰腐腐剧不官方盘点；</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，附带一次刚结束的2025年gmm新剧押宝；</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，涉及到众多不为人知的古早八卦和近期热点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，是航空路春夏新欢天尼cp的磕🍬记录。</span></p><span></span><p><span>话不多说，一起听吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 双饭团小子24年看过的唯一一部泰腐——泰版消失的初恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">03:39</a> 泰版樱桃魔法是24gmm翻拍屎里淘金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="559">09:19</a> 航空路春夏24年放弃泰腐，转投日腐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 为爱所困2024 非常贴脸的童工翻拍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 百花齐的gl元年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a> 三台顶流拿得出，丫丫看泰国明星洗脑包</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> yinwar事件告诉我们永远不要对他泰bl真情实感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">19:49</a> 我们的秘密是细腻和演技的集中狂舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a> 亦敌亦友的前世今生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> sky超高起点，从nadao神剧荷尔蒙出道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2032">33:52</a> nani不被捧的流星花园f4</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a> 天尼cp的红绳定情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2614">43:34</a> 不曾遗忘的暮色是成熟的纯爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2793">46:33</a> 世纪之爱的快乐轻喜剧重生故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3034">50:34</a> 航空路春夏2025年gmm推介会的押宝推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3046">50:46</a> 女版禁忌密友比正版禁忌密友更有爆相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> pondpuwin的舒适区——me and thee</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 明年真正的神剧预定——鸡丝4搭，aof执导，泰版刻在我心底的名字（ticket to the heaven)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3346">55:46</a> 25年泰腐发展三法则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3569">59:29</a> 秘密爱，泰腐短剧崛起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3626">1:00:26</a> 小众题材挖掘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3615">1:00:15</a> 双饭团小子和航空路春夏的新年寄语</span></p><span></span><p><span>拓展阅读：</span></p><span></span><p><span>泰版消失的初恋</span></p><span></span><p><span>泰版樱桃魔法</span></p><span></span><p><span>美妆搭档情人</span></p><span></span><p><span>为爱所困2024</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span>地球倾斜23.5度</span></p><span></span><p><span>亦敌亦友</span></p><span></span><p><span>荷尔蒙</span></p><span></span><p><span>羽你同行</span></p><span></span><p><span>泰版流星花园</span></p><span></span><p><span>不曾遗忘的暮色</span></p><span></span><p><span>世纪之爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>秘密爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>娘娘腔的日记</span></p><span></span><p><span>极速恋人</span></p>]]></description>
