    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闲暇小岛，欢迎所有需要闲暇的伙伴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目你将听到航空路春夏压箱底的师生恋爱影视剧安利，也欢迎有喜欢相似电视剧的小伙伴多给我安利一些好看的剧，想看，🥹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容提要：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 师生恋开局之前的近期韩剧安利——安畔锡导演《毕业》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">03:02</a> 毕业中塑造的三位特色老师形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a> 带入徐慧珍是因为现代人对于自身职业身份的不认可</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 师生恋的白月光——《魔女的条件》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 《魔女的条件》讲的就是寻找自由国度的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a> 《魔女的条件》为什么是航空路春夏的师生恋白月光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a> 《魔女》中女主角一定要生小孩就是圣母么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a>《密会》是具像化的爱情和文学作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> 《密会》用音乐捕捉情欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1533">25:33</a> 最感人的告白不是付出生命而是学会擦地板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">27:42</a> 师生恋中的小甜点——《终极一班》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a>为什么我们老中人酷爱师生恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2212">36:52</a> 可以补番时的师生恋遗珠片单</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期拓展阅读：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《魔女的条件》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《密会》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《钢琴课》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《终极一班》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《热带雨》</span></p><span></span><p><span>93版《高校教师》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《中学圣日记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《龙樱》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《极道鲜师》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《麻辣老师gto》</span></p>]]></description>
