  <item>
    <title>凯源发家史——男生学院自习室十周年特别企划</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660f9c9f4f66d1c1da238d67</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660f9c9f4f66d1c1da238d67</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Apr 2024 06:39:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闲暇小岛，欢迎所有需要闲暇的伙伴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2024年第三期节目，迟到一周更新。本期节目为TFBOYS男生学院自习室十周年的特别企划。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本次企划借由TFBOYS家族自制综艺——男生学院自习室十周年的契机，从故事开讲啦，彗星来的那一夜，长大的代价三个篇章，与大家一同回顾红极一时的凯源cp。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，你会听到远古时期的凯源发家史，</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，你会听到曾经的凯源同人四大名著，</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，你会沉浸式体验如何高效的追星嗑糖。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 上岛之前的专业术语科普——帝国和岛的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a> 凯源超话是衍生新浪超话榜的祖师爷</span></p><span></span><p><span>故事开讲啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a> 男生学院自习室到底是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">07:52</a> 男生学院自习室的初设定居然是时髦的学霸 x 校霸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> 青涩感是男生学院自习室最好的良药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> TFBOYS是打破韩流和选秀的第一人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a> 黄锐的策划成功的原因是塑造人设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 凯源cp最早的人设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 男生学院自习室是tfboys无成本发家的唯一选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 男生学院自习室名台词放送和日漫吐槽风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> 台风四子现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 三代四代是凯源养成系的代餐</span></p><span></span><p><span>彗星来的那一夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 凯源成为国民cp跟二创的内在联系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 从b站cp二创扯到花间“先皇”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> 凯源四大名著</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 四大名著的影响力=长篇+影视化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1319">21:59</a> 凯源的应援曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 二创让更多人了解这对cp</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a> 仙后的团名浪漫主义和永远铭记逝去之人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1521">25:21</a> 双饭团小子最爱的凯源同人《热带美人鱼》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 《重游》记录下凯源开始和成长的点点滴滴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 双饭团小子是凯源真爱粉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1944">32:24</a> 航空路春夏为双饭团小子嗑糖写的三篇凯源文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 凯源cp仙品好嗑的几点</span></p><span></span><p><span>成为大人的代价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2232">37:12</a> 我们参与过的线下追星路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 双饭团小子分享的凯源粉丝打卡路线a</span></p><span></span><p><span>八中——南开——恩心小镇——南滨路——长江国际</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2378">39:38</a> 南滨路的难忘回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2406">40:06</a> 凯源的715活动——见面会和展览会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">41:40</a> 王源巡演中的重庆快闪活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2554">42:34</a> 双饭团小子分享的凯源杂志打卡路线b</span></p><span></span><p><span>白象居——地下通道——龙门浩老街——观音桥便利店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 日月光广场和观音桥便利店都因为疫情倒闭了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2679">44:39</a> 双饭团小子追过印象最深的两场演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> 凯源个人演唱会的曲目居然是情侣对唱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2812">46:52</a> 双饭团小子嗑拉了的19年的凯源分手期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2869">47:49</a> 王源演唱会是走情感向，王俊凯是享受style</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2921">48:41</a> 双饭团小子也有过嗑cp的枯水期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2989">49:49</a> 单飞的两个阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3116">51:56</a> 双饭团小子和航空路春夏出不了凯源坑的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 追凯源的不会是坏孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a> 我们和凯源不可复制的十年</span></p><span></span><p><span>闲暇小岛，享受闲暇。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，你可以看到被遗忘的90视角和千禧回忆，感受十八线小镇成长和北上广都市闯荡的思维碰撞，在这里，你可以收获一群疯疯癫癫，元气满满，个性十足的闲暇岛民，在这里，你可以和所有年纪，所有性别，所有态度，所有视角的岛民相遇，看到没有那么有用的社会人士是如何用无用之学闯荡社会的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然，闲暇小岛，只是一处小小岛屿，但希望这里可以给大家提供一次心灵之旅，让你获得疲惫生活的小小闲暇。</span></p>]]></description>
