    <title>热辣滚烫带来的健身潮能让运动苦手伏地挺身么？健身为了美还是幸福</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e0a1239bf20df4c8815210</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e0a1239bf20df4c8815210</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Feb 2024 15:22:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>闲暇小岛，欢迎所有需要闲暇的伙伴！</span></p><p><span>2024年第二期节目，最后一刻完成2月的kpi，欢迎大家来闲暇小岛做客。本期节目将继续由航空路春夏和黄泥坝李子柒唠一唠聊一聊健身的那些事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 黄泥坝李子柒的健身动机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> 同志健身也有鄙视金字塔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 黄泥坝李子柒和航空路春夏对健身的不同态度</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> 同志是如何在健身中match彼此眼神的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 航空路春夏对私教的痛苦回忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 健身观念比健身重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 李子柒过年也要坐车去健身的狂热经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 健身的克星是懒——古代春夏会被懒饿死</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 健身的契机是身体变差</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">15:22</a> 不健身参加经济类运动可以么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 跳舞是为了艺术表达</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1123">18:43</a> 大小城市健身理念的差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a> 健身热潮的本末倒置是对身材的过度批判</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 健身房常常出现的四种人群</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 健身房激情是一种艺术形式还是确有其事</span></p>]]></description>
